# Raw Airtable export backups contain real contact PII (names, emails,
# phone numbers) - never commit them. See revenue-os-crm-airtable.md's
# backup destination/retention decision.
backups/

# Same reasoning applies to the actual staging/target SQLite databases
# built from those backups - real contact PII, never committed. Rebuild
# with continuity-bridge/scripts/build_staging_db.py, which IS committed.
databases/
